B.bpR=new A.df(B.aAp,"\u1e6c\u0101 (\u0637) \u2014 It is a heavy letter: the tongue tip touches where T\u0101 does, but the tongue rises and the sound is full. Open the Letters school in the Academy and start the lesson for \u1e6c\u0101: you will see the letter, practise it and answer a gentle question. Say its name three times, slowly. Which letter did you learn just before this one?")
