B.bnr=new A.df(B.aFO,"\u1e92\u0101 (\u0638) \u2014 It is a heavy letter: the tongue tip is at the edge of the upper front teeth and the tongue rises. Open the Letters school in the Academy and start the lesson for \u1e92\u0101: you will see the letter, practise it and answer a gentle question. Say its name three times, slowly. Which letter did you learn just before this one?")
