B.boG=new A.df(B.az_,"\u02bfAyn (\u0639) \u2014 It is made in the middle of the throat. Open the Letters school in the Academy and start the lesson for \u02bfAyn: you will see the letter, practise it and answer a gentle question. Say its name three times, slowly. Which letter did you learn just before this one?")
