B.bnX=new A.df(B.aGX,"Ghayn (\u063a) \u2014 It is made at the top of the throat, nearest the mouth, and it is a heavy letter. Open the Letters school in the Academy and start the lesson for Ghayn: you will see the letter, practise it and answer a gentle question. Say its name three times, slowly. Which letter did you learn just before this one?")
