B.aIy=s(["qaf","letter qaf","the qaf"],t.s)
B.bsk=new A.df(B.aIy,"Q\u0101f (\u0642) \u2014 It is a heavy letter, made at the very back of the tongue against the soft palate. Open the Letters school in the Academy and start the lesson for Q\u0101f: you will see the letter, practise it and answer a gentle question. Say its name three times, slowly. Which letter did you learn just before this one?")
