B.Hn=s(["I am sorry, that is a painful thing to go through, and feeling broken does not mean you are failing. Allah says: \u201cFor indeed, with hardship [will be] ease.\u201d (Qur'an 94:5). Be gentle with yourself and lean on someone you trust. A question about the ruling on a divorce depends on your own situation, so please take it to a scholar; I will not guess at it. Sakina is a quiet page here if you want somewhere to sit with this."],t.s)
